## G2 probe — sg048's second blocker (read-only, no repo write)

In-process monkeypatch of `sqlalchemy.engine.mock.MockConnection.exec_driver_sql` in a `/tmp` script
(no repository file written); then run the full offline upgrade programmatically:

```
$ cd backend && timeout 120 venv/bin/python /tmp/opencode/sg146/probe_sg048.py 2>/dev/null
